  unitName: Earth Ghost
  unitId: 30202
  unitNumber: 260
  description: This subspecies of Metal Ghost is said to have changed after having
    amassed extensive records on the element of earth. Of all the talkative members
    of the metal record species, this one in particular is known for its reticence.
    This perplexes many who come across them, however it is also said that they stare
    at whomever they come across with grave discontent. No one has ever been able
    to ascertain exactly what they're thinking.
